  "description": "After an eventful night full of tears and a live concert, Gyeom finds himself tangled up in a hot night with aspiring musician and rising star, Yo-Han. Inspired after a mind-blowing night, Yo-Han decides to look for new band members to join him in producing a new album. But when he once again encounters the mysterious boy who stole his heart with his tears, Yo-Han refuses to let him go and suggests Gyeom join his band as a bassist. Will these two be able to create a new playlist for their lives?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
